OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh bombing forensic
OL,4,Ainvestigation was 'efficient', inquiry
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA forensic science expert has told the
OL,8,FOmagh Bombing Inquiry that the forensic
OL,9,Finvestigation into the bombing was
OL,10,F"efficient".
OL,12,FProf Angela Gallop told the inquiry on
OL,13,FMonday that the scientific
OL,14,Finvestigation into that scale of
OL,15,Fbombing is "extremely complex".
OL,17,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,18,Fpregnant with twins, died in the
OL,19,Fbombing in the County Tyrone town on 15
OL,20,FAugust 1998 - it was the biggest single
OL,21,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
